# DOI links resolve correctly in browsers but doi.org returns HTTP 403 to
# automated link checkers (bot protection), causing false-positive failures.
# The DOI itself is valid and stable.
https://doi\.org/
# GitHub intermittently returns 404 to authenticated link-checker requests for
# the stargazers page even though the public repository and badge are valid.
https://github\.com/ToxMCP/toxmcp/stargazers
# Sibling ToxMCP repos that are still private return 404 to the link
# checker (the repo-scoped GITHUB_TOKEN cannot read other private repos).
# Remove these as each repo is made public.
https://github\.com/ToxMCP/bioactivity-pod-mcp
